meta {
  name: Delete Entry
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.EntryService/DeleteEntry
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "id": "{{entryId}}"
  }
}

docs {
  # Delete Entry

  Soft deletes a translation entry.

  ## Authentication
  Requires valid access token.

  ## Request
  - `id` (required): The UUID of the entry to delete

  ## Behavior
  - This is a soft delete (sets `deleted_at` timestamp)
  - Associated localizations are not deleted
  - Entry history is preserved

  ## Response
  Returns an empty response on success.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {}
  ```

  ## Errors
  - `INVALID_ARGUMENT`: entry id is required
  - `NOT_FOUND`: entry not found
  - `INTERNAL`: failed to delete entry
}
